# generator.obj -- procedurally generated placeholder (no downloaded
# asset needed -- see generator.h). A boxy utility generator: main
# housing + top vent cap + a small front indicator panel + a
# rear-corner exhaust pipe. Local origin sits at floor level (base),
# same convention as Crate/Stool/WoodenPallet -- Generator::Draw()
# uses m_Position directly with no pivot shift. Roughly 0.9m wide x
# 1.6m tall (housing + vent + pipe) x 0.6m deep.
